   "versionNonce": 35019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "id                 Plaud's file id (PK)\nfilename, started_at, duration_s\n\nVERIFICATION FACTS \u2014 never inferred\n  audio_sha256     hashed after write\n  remote_md5       what Plaud claimed\n  size_ok          not truncated\n  audio_kind       magic bytes decodable\n  md5_verified     byte-identical (rare)\n\nSTAGE CLOCKS \u2014 what has been done\n  downloaded_at  transcribed_at\n  summarized_at  sentiment_at\n  extracted_at   indexed_at\n  noted_at       pruned_at\n\nA null clock is the work queue.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "id                 Plaud's file id (PK)\nfilename, started_at, duration_s\n\nVERIFICATION FACTS \u2014 never inferred\n  audio_sha256     hashed after write\n  remote_md5       what Plaud claimed\n  size_ok          not truncated\n  audio_kind       magic bytes decodable\n  md5_verified     byte-identical (rare)\n\nSTAGE CLOCKS \u2014 what has been done\n  downloaded_at  transcribed_at\n  summarized_at  sentiment_at\n  extracted_at   indexed_at\n  noted_at       pruned_at\n\nA null clock is the work queue.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "hub_note",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 578,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 60,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#b91c1c",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 86882,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 86882,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Every destructive decision reads from here.\nprune requires size_ok AND audio_kind AND sha256\nAND transcript AND age \u2014 re-checked at prune time,\nnever trusted from an earlier run.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Every destructive decision reads from here.\nprune requires size_ok AND audio_kind AND sha256\nAND transcript AND age \u2014 re-checked at prune time,\nnever trusted from an earlier run.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "keep_h",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 680,
   "width": 460,
   "height": 26,
   "angle": 0,
